<div class="pure-u-1  dek-aff-wrapper">
		<div class="trinity-tts-pb" dir="ltr" style="display: none; font: 12px / 18px Verdana, Arial; height: 80px; line-height: 80px; text-align: left;">
	      <strong style="font-weight: 400">Getting your <a href="//trinityaudio.ai" style="color: #4b4a4a; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700;">Trinity Audio</a> player ready...</strong>
	</div>	<div class="dek">
		<p>Want to make chewy homemade ramen noodles like you find in Japanese soup shops? With a few special tools and a block of free time, these noodles are worth the extra effort.</p>	</div>
	</div>
	</div>
			<div class="ad-container-wrapper  ad-type-out_of_page">
			<div
		id="out-of-page"
		class="tmbi-ad-slot ay-ad-unit-wrapper "
		data-slot="out_of_page"
		data-ad-unit-path="/6178/toh_mobile/detail/out_of_page"
		data-targeting="{&quot;pos&quot;:&quot;out_of_page&quot;,&quot;theme&quot;:&quot;enhanced&quot;,&quot;DAI&quot;:&quot;n&quot;}"
