</section>		<div class="author-footer">
						<div class="author-entry">
				<div class="author-bio">
											<div class="category">
														<div class="author-chip author">Author</div>
													</div>
											<div class="author-name">Suzanne Podhaizer</div>
					<div class="author-short-bio">
						Suzanne is a chef, farmer and award-winning food writer living in the Northeast Kingdom of Vermont. In her years as a restaurateur, caterer and cooking teacher, she has developed hundreds of recipes, most of which center around seasonal food. At Taste of Home, Suzanne shares even more of her fantastic recipes, from meatballs to mochi doughnuts.					</div>
					<div class="author-read-link">
						<a href="https://www.tasteofhome.com/author/suzanne-podhaizer/" data-name="recipe engagement" data-module="author-footer" data-position="author-link" data-placement="" aria-label="Read more about this author">Read More</a>					</div>
				</div>
									<div class="author-image">
						<img src="https://www.tasteofhome.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/IMG_4433-Suzanne-Podhaizer.jpg?resize=200,200" alt="Suzanne Podhaizer" loading="lazy" data-tmbi-lazy="true" width="150" height="150" class="avatar avatar-150 photo author-image" />
					</div>
							</div>
					</div>
		<div class="inline-recirc-footer">
	<div class="recirc-wrapper">

		<span class="recipe-ui-label">AUTUMN HAS ARRIVED</span>

